OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrightest in the southeast
OL,6,Ffirst thing, becoming breezy here in
OL,7,Fadvance of cloud and periods of rain
OL,8,Fmaking very gradual progress
OL,9,Fnorthwards. These more unsettled
OL,10,Fconditions will very gradually
OL,11,Fdisplace extensive low cloud and fog
OL,12,Fin northern parts. Near-normal
OL,13,Ftemperatures.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTonight:FCloudy and wet during the
OL,16,Fevening and overnight, with a swathe
OL,17,Fof rain moving very slowly northwards
OL,18,Fbefore stalling over the region, with
OL,19,Fsome heavier spells possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
