OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA wet start with some
OL,6,Fheavier spells of rain. Both the cloud
OL,7,Fand the rain will very gradually fade,
OL,8,Fto perhaps leave some late brighter
OL,9,Fspells. Temperatures near normal.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FBreezy at first Thursday, but becoming
OL,13,Fdrier and eventually brighter into the
OL,14,Fweekend as temperatures fall away,
OL,15,Fwith overnight frosts developing
OL,16,Fwidely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
